  <!-- 12c. OUR STORY — WE'RE SKEPTICS TOO                  -->
  <section class="v10-section parchment">
    <div class="v10-wrap-narrow">
      <div class="v10-story reveal" x-intersect="$el.classList.add('visible')" x-init="setTimeout(() => $el.classList.add('visible'), 100)">
        <div class="v10-story-founder">
          <img src="{{ 'cc-v8-founder-portrait.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Chris Booth, Coastline co-founder">
        </div>
        <span class="v10-eyebrow" style="display:block; text-align:center; margin-bottom: 20px;">A Note From One Of The Co-Founders</span>
        <div class="v10-divider" style="margin: 0 auto 28px;"></div>
        <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 48px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 28px; color: #0A0A0A;">We&rsquo;re skeptics too.</h2>
        <div class="v10-story-body">
          <p>We started Coastline because we were tired of the same con. A shiny bottle, a vague promise, a proprietary blend hiding how little of the good stuff you&rsquo;re actually getting. Then you cross-reference the label against the literature and realize the doses are a fraction of what the studies used.</p>
          <p>So we built the thing we wanted to take ourselves. We picked 13 compounds with the strongest human data. We dosed every one at the clinical level. We published every amount on the label. We had four scientists argue about every pairing until the formula earned its place.</p>
          <p>If you&rsquo;re skeptical of longevity supplements, good. So are we. Read the ingredients, check the doses, compare it to anything else on the shelf. Then decide.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="v10-story-signature"><strong>Chris Booth</strong>Co-founder, Coastline</p>
        <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:32px;">
          <a href="#pricing-product-apr26" class="v10-btn">Get Started Today &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

