  <section class="v10-section parchment">
    <div class="v10-wrap-narrow">
      <div class="v10-section-head reveal" x-intersect="$el.classList.add('visible')" x-init="setTimeout(() => $el.classList.add('visible'), 100)">
        <span class="v10-eyebrow">Common Questions</span>
        <div class="v10-divider"></div>
        <h2>Before you start.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="v10-faq reveal" x-intersect="$el.classList.add('visible')" x-init="setTimeout(() => $el.classList.add('visible'), 100)">
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 1" @click="toggleFaq(1)">What is Coastline? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 1 ? 'open' : ''"><p>Coastline is a complete daily longevity system &mdash; 13 science-backed ingredients split into a morning ritual (easy-scoop powder sachet + softgel) and two evening capsules. Every dose matches the level used in clinical studies. No mystery ingredients, no hidden doses, every milligram published on the label.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 2" @click="toggleFaq(2)">How do I know it&rsquo;s for me? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 2 ? 'open' : ''"><p>If you&rsquo;re over 35 and want to support your health for the long run &mdash; sharper focus, steadier energy, better sleep, stronger joints &mdash; without managing a dozen different bottles, Coastline was built for you. It&rsquo;s gender-neutral, caffeine-free, and designed to fit into the routine you already have.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 3" @click="toggleFaq(3)">How do I actually take Coastline? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 3 ? 'open' : ''"><p>Morning: scoop the powder into your free glass shaker with water and take one softgel with breakfast. Evening: take two capsules 30-60 minutes before bed. That&rsquo;s the entire system &mdash; two moments, under a minute each.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 4" @click="toggleFaq(4)">When will I notice a difference? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 4 ? 'open' : ''"><p>Most customers report sharper mornings and steadier energy in 2-3 weeks. Deep-structural benefits &mdash; sleep quality, joint comfort, biomarker shifts &mdash; typically build through weeks 4-8 of consistent use.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 5" @click="toggleFaq(5)">Why 13 ingredients instead of 75? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 5 ? 'open' : ''"><p>Because doses matter more than ingredient count. A supplement with 75 ingredients at trace amounts hides behind mystery ingredients. Coastline uses 13 compounds at the exact dose used in the studies that proved they work &mdash; published on the label, every milligram.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 6" @click="toggleFaq(6)">Is there caffeine or sugar? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 6 ? 'open' : ''"><p>No caffeine, no added sugar. Coastline is vegan, GMP-certified, 3rd-party tested, and made in the USA. The Coastal Lemonade flavor is naturally sweetened.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 7" @click="toggleFaq(7)">Can I take it with medication? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 7 ? 'open' : ''"><p>Every ingredient is well-studied and generally recognized as safe at these doses, but we always recommend checking with your doctor if you&rsquo;re on prescription medication &mdash; especially blood thinners or blood pressure medication.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 8" @click="toggleFaq(8)">What if it doesn&rsquo;t work for me? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 8 ? 'open' : ''"><p>You have 60 days to try it risk-free. If it&rsquo;s not right for you, contact us for a full refund &mdash; no questions, no return shipping fees, no hoops. We stand behind the science.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="v10-faq-item">
          <button type="button" class="v10-faq-q" :aria-expanded="faq === 9" @click="toggleFaq(9)">Can I cancel my subscription? <span class="plus">+</span></button>
          <div class="v10-faq-a" :class="faq === 9 ? 'open' : ''"><p>Yes &mdash; cancel any time with one click from your account. No phone calls, no penalties, no pressure. We make it easy because we believe the product speaks for itself.</p></div>
